#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/index.md:8
msgid "协议概览"
msgstr "Protocol Overview"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/index.md:10
msgid "XGen Link 实现面向有界、同步嵌入式通信的 Wire v1。各 profile 使用相同的帧头和扩展编码。收发与转发只接受版本字段为 1 的帧。"
msgstr ""
"XGen Link implements Wire v1 for bounded, synchronous embedded communication. All profiles use the same "
"header and extension encoding. Endpoints and relays only accept frames with version 1."

